# Deliberately minimal deliver configuration.
#
# Presence of this file stops `fastlane deliver` from prompting
# "No deliver configuration found in the current directory. Do you want to
# setup deliver?" - which crashes CI (non-interactive) before any App Store
# Connect API call is made.
#
# All submission options are passed on the CLI in
# .github/workflows/store-production-release.yml (skip metadata/screenshots/
# binary upload, submit latest processed TestFlight build for review).
# The App Store Connect listing itself is the source of truth.
